nodes": []}, "id": "29037681739230393", "version": "3.3.14"}, "id": "994646723277799", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29037681739230393"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "- New app icon\n- New Live TV screen with categories, channels and a live preview side by side\n- Star your favorite categories, synced across your devices\n- New Catch Up screen to browse past programs, with seeking inside a program\n- Continue Watching resumes a Catch Up program where you left off\n- Favorites category in the TV Guide: your favorite channels open first\n- Continue Watching shows which playlist each title comes from when you have more than one\n- Continue Watching artwork no longer shows a title twice\n- Different shows with the same name are no longer grouped together", "created_date": 1795418768, "id": "29037681739230393", "version": "3.3.14", "version_code": 4183, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29037681739230393"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "- Fixed crashes when some posters and images loaded\n- Big new cards for Oscar Winners, Emmy Winners, Complete Sagas and Complete Series on Home\n- Home rails in a new order, so big cards, posters and channels take turns\n- New Reload button in the player restarts a stream that freezes\n- More Home rails for playlists that don't include movie database info\n- Top 10 Movies and Top 10 TV Shows also appear for playlists without movie database info\n- Continue Watching and Favorites show clean artwork, without the title twice\n- A new profile starts with its own watch history\n- Lighter syncing between your devices", "created_date": 1794993019, "id": "28975051348826766", "version": "3.3.13", "version_code": 4182, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29037681739230393"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "- New parental controls: set a PIN in Settings to hide adult content and ask for it before playing\n- Adult categories are also recognized by name, like \"For Adults\"\n- Different shows with the same name are no longer grouped together\n- Titles in Arabic, Persian and other non-Latin scripts are grouped correctly", "created_date": 1794552252, "id": "28902980379367197", "version": "3.3.12", "version_code": 4181, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29037681739230393"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "- Search ignores accents, spacing and word order\n- A PIN-protected profile asks for the PIN when the app opens\n- Reminder taps and alerts wait for the profile you pick", "created_date": 1794129702, "id": "28833769896288246", "version": "3.3.11", "version_code": 4180, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29037681739230393"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "- Faster launch: the app no longer stalls while it connects to the Meta store\n- Movies open right away, without the \"not responding\" hang\n- Purchases are verified one by one, so an expired purchase can no longer block a new one\n- Cancelling the Meta purchase sheet returns to the app at once\n- Ask: search in your own words across movies, series, live TV and the guide\n- Cloud restore shows live progress, with Continue in background\n- Extra devices add-on: 3 more devices on your account, up to 8\n- Match reminders and favorite-team alerts before kickoff\n- Device management offers Extra devices at any device count\n- The XR control bar shows the right title after switching versions\n- Large libraries open more reliably, and Continue Watching keeps one row per title when you switch versions", "created_date": 1794032967, "id": "28818135527851683", "version": "3.3.10", "version_code": 4179, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}